  <%# ── WHY ELECTRIC ───────────────────────────────────────────────────── %>
  <div class="lp-sec">
    <div class="lp-wrap">
      <div class="lp-sec-head">
        <div class="lp-kicker">Why an E-Foil</div>
        <h2>Flying over water — finally for everyone</h2>
        <p>Traditional foiling needs waves, wind or a tow. The Duotone E-Foil gives you the power, so you can ride whenever and wherever you want.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="lp-grid-3">
        <div class="lp-card">
          <div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M13 2L3 14h7l-1 8 10-12h-7l1-8z" fill="currentColor"/></svg></div>
          <h3>Silent electric power</h3>
          <p>A whisper-quiet motor drives you up onto the foil with a flick of the wireless throttle. No noise, no fumes — just smooth, instant lift.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="lp-card">
          <div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M3 12s3-7 9-7 9 7 9 7-3 7-9 7-9-7-9-7z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/></svg></div>
          <h3>Ride anywhere</h3>
          <p>Glassy lake, flat sea, an evening with zero wind — it doesn't matter. If there's water, you can fly above it.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="lp-card">
          <div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 3v6m0 0l3-3m-3 3L9 6M5 13l1.5 6h11L19 13" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div>
          <h3>Up & flying fast</h3>
