        <div class="lp-stat"><div class="v">1–2</div><div class="l">Sessions to foil</div></div>
        <div class="lp-stat"><div class="v">100%</div><div class="l">Electric & silent</div></div>
      </div>
      <p style="text-align:center;font-size:12.5px;margin-top:14px;opacity:.7">*Ride time varies with rider weight, speed and conditions. Batteries are swappable for all-day sessions.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <%# ── HOW IT WORKS ───────────────────────────────────────────────────── %>
  <div class="lp-sec" id="lp-how">
    <div class="lp-wrap">
      <div class="lp-sec-head">
        <div class="lp-kicker">How it works</div>
        <h2>From the beach to flying in three steps</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="lp-steps">
        <div class="lp-step">
          <h3>Power up</h3>
          <p>Clip in the battery, pair the wireless hand controller and paddle out. Everything is ready in minutes.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="lp-step">
          <h3>Squeeze the throttle</h3>
          <p>Lying or kneeling, ease the throttle and let the motor build speed until the board comes alive under you.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="lp-step">
          <h3>Rise & glide</h3>
          <p>As speed builds the foil lifts you clear of the surface. Shift your weight, ease back the power, and fly in near silence.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <%# ── PRODUCTS ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────── %>
  <div class="lp-sec alt">
    <div class="lp-wrap">
      <div class="lp-sec-head">
        <div class="lp-kicker">Shop the range</div>
        <h2>Get your Duotone E-Foil</h2>
        <p>Genuine Duotone gear, in stock and ready to ship across Europe.</p>
      </div>

      <% if @products.present? %>
        <div class="lp-products">
          <% @products.each do |product| %>
            <%= render 'spree/products/product', product: product, show_variant_picker: false %>
          <% end %>
        </div>
        <div style="text-align:center;margin-top:40px">
          <a href="<%= @shop_url %>" class="lp-btn lp-btn-primary" data-lp-cta="shop-grid">View all E-Foil gear</a>
        </div>
      <% else %>
        <div class="lp-empty">
          <p>Our Duotone E-Foil line-up is landing soon. Browse the full collection or get in touch and we'll help you build your setup.</p>
          <a href="<%= @shop_url %>" class="lp-btn lp-btn-primary" data-lp-cta="shop-empty">Browse the collection</a>
        </div>
      <% end %>
    </div>
  </div>

  <%# ── FAQ ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── %>
  <div class="lp-sec">
    <div class="lp-wrap">
      <div class="lp-sec-head">
        <div class="lp-kicker">Questions</div>
        <h2>Everything you want to know</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="lp-faq">
        <details open>
          <summary>Do I need waves or wind to ride an E-Foil?</summary>
          <p>No. An electric foil has its own silent motor, so you can ride on completely flat water — lakes, calm sea, anywhere. No waves, no wind and no boat needed.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>Is the Duotone E-Foil hard to learn?</summary>
          <p>Most riders are foiling within their first one to two sessions. You start on your knees at low power, then progress to standing as your balance develops — the wireless hand controller manages the speed for you.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>How long does the battery last?</summary>
          <p>Ride time depends on rider weight, speed and conditions, with typical sessions running well over an hour. Batteries are swappable, so a spare lets you ride all day.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>Do you ship across Europe and offer a warranty?</summary>
          <p>Yes. We're an official Duotone dealer with fast EU-wide shipping, a 2-year warranty and expert support before and after your purchase.</p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <%# ── FINAL CTA ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────── %>
  <div class="lp-final">
    <div class="lp-wrap">
      <h2>Your first flight is one ride away.</h2>
      <p>Join the riders gliding silently above the water on a Duotone E-Foil. Order today with fast EU shipping and full dealer support.</p>
      <a href="<%= @shop_url %>" class="lp-btn lp-btn-primary" data-lp-cta="shop-final">Shop the Duotone E-Foil</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<%# ── Landing-page CTA tracking (GA4) ───────────────────────────────────── %>
<script>
  (function(){
    if (typeof gtag === 'function') {
      gtag('event', 'view_promotion', { promotion_id: 'lp_efoil_duotone', promotion_name: 'Duotone E-Foil Landing' });
    }
    document.querySelectorAll('.lp-efoil [data-lp-cta]').forEach(function(el){
